herdr-task
==========

Vendored, unmodified copy of the shepherdr tasks CLI. Source, commit and paths are
recorded in UPSTREAM; the MIT license text is in LICENSE and applies to every file
in this directory.

Run it through bin/collie-task, which puts this directory first on sys.path. The
package keeps its upstream name `herdr_task` so a diff against upstream stays small;
it does not import anything from shepherdr's mods/tasks tree.

No compiled artifacts (bytecode, binaries) are vendored: the launcher and
bin/collie-task both set sys.dont_write_bytecode = True.

Local patches: none yet. Any future patch must be listed here with the file and the
reason, and UPSTREAM stays pinned to the commit the base copy came from.
